title: "Rupsha–Pasur Morphodynamics: Spatially lagged curvature–migration coupling in a tidal river corridor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Iftikhar
    given-names: Afif
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - "river morphodynamics"
  - "remote sensing"
  - "Landsat"
  - "channel migration"
  - "channel curvature"
  - "Bayesian modeling"
  - "distributed-lag model"
  - "tidal rivers"
  - "Bangladesh"
abstract: >
  Reproducible analysis of spatially lagged curvature–migration coupling along the tidal Rupsha–Pasur river corridor in southwest Bangladesh using multi-decadal Landsat-derived channel geometry and hierarchical Bayesian distributed-lag modeling.
